<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Eshop Activation Mail</title>
    <style>
        /* Add your CSS styles here */
        body{
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 16px;
            min-width: 100%;
            color: #222222;
        }
        a{
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        h1{
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        p{
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .email-wrapper{
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .email-header{
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-body{
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .email-footer{
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #666666;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .otp-code{
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f0f6ff;
            color: #007bff;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>Welcome to Eshop!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
            <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
            <p>Thank you for registering with Eshop. Use the verification code below to activate your account:</p>
            <p><span class="otp-code"><%= otp %></span></p>
            <p>This code will expire in 5 minutes.</p>
            <p>If you did not register for an account, please ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer"> 
            <p>&copy; 2024 Eshop. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>